    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About this game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded on an unknown planet, Mani and Stefan must work together to get back home. Mani\u00b4s ability to gather and craft gadgets complements Stefan\u00b4s combat expertise. With these skillsets you need to find clever ways to explore the areas in this wacky adventure game.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After crash-landing on an unknown planet, Mani\u00b4s shoes evaporated. This left him with nothing but his trusted robot friend Stefan, a blender and a shovel. Together they\u00b4ll explore various biomes on their quest to get out in space and finally back home. Gather resources, craft the latest in Manickologist technology and crawl through scary dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Mani\u00b4s perspective as you explore this world with an unknown language. Encounter strange Cognimals and Tourists on your journey back home. A journey where every challenge requires creative thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swap between characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mani the Manickologist</strong>: Gather resources and find hidden treasures with his shovel. Craft gadgets and juices with his blender. Playing as Mani allows more efficient movement and exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stefan the Robot</strong>: Switch to Stefan for combat-focused gameplay. Equipping different gadgets activates different combat abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the lush green world in whatever way or order that best suit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find treasure maps, secret crafting recipes, and valuable loot scattered across the island.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256470/extras/f9853022998bfb6b2ca700dfd4473666.poster.avif?t=1755143168\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256470/extras/f9853022998bfb6b2ca700dfd4473666.webm?t=1755143168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256470/extras/f9853022998bfb6b2ca700dfd4473666.mp4?t=1755143168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural dungeons and challenging boss battles</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crawl through procedural dungeons swarming with spooky Cognimals and filled with treasure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your combat skills in unique challenging boss fights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256470/extras/b39d7a8893fd19f747d8f6d084f20d25.poster.avif?t=1755143168\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256470/extras/b39d7a8893fd19f747d8f6d084f20d25.webm?t=1755143168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256470/extras/b39d7a8893fd19f747d8f6d084f20d25.mp4?t=1755143168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gathering and crafting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather for various materials scattered around the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with blending these materials or find recipes to craft juices or gadgets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256470/extras/109a9b1dba72bb9cb4d6039cf48b75ef.poster.avif?t=1755143168\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256470/extras/109a9b1dba72bb9cb4d6039cf48b75ef.webm?t=1755143168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256470/extras/109a9b1dba72bb9cb4d6039cf48b75ef.mp4?t=1755143168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique story and characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet unique colorful characters as you listen to the story from Mani\u00b4s point of view.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the story as it develops without having to watch long cutscenes or read dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the backstory of the different characters. From Mani\u00b4s feet-insecurity to Uncleman\u00b4s mysterious past.</p></li></ul>",
