ever way or order that best suit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find treasure maps, secret crafting recipes, and valuable loot scattered across the island.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256470/extras/f9853022998bfb6b2ca700dfd4473666.poster.avif?t=1755143168\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256470/extras/f9853022998bfb6b2ca700dfd4473666.webm?t=1755143168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256470/extras/f9853022998bfb6b2ca700dfd4473666.mp4?t=1755143168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural dungeons and challenging boss battles</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crawl through procedural dungeons swarming with spooky Cognimals and filled with treasure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your combat skills in unique challenging boss fights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256470/extras/b39d7a8893fd19f747d8f6d084f20d25.poster.avif?t=1755143168\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256470/extras/b39d7a8893fd19f747d8f6d084f20d25.webm?t=1755143168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256470/extras/b39d7a8893fd19f747d8f6d084f20d25.mp4?t=1755143168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gathering and crafting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather for various materials scattered around the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with blending these materials or find recipes to craft juices or gadgets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256470/extras/109a9b1dba72bb9cb4d6039cf48b75ef.poster.avif?t=1755143168\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256470/extras/109a9b1dba72bb9cb4d6039cf48b75ef.webm?t=1755143168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256470/extras/109a9b1dba72bb9cb4d6039cf48b75ef.mp4?t=1755143168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique story and characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet unique colorful characters as you listen to the story from Mani\u00b4s point of view.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the story as it develops without having to watch long cutscenes or read dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the backstory of the different characters. From Mani\u00b4s feet-insecurity to Uncleman\u00b4s mysterious past.</p></li></ul>",
